    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.31,
      "end": 10.93,
      "text": "They've gone from under four times average income up to nearly eight, but they cost roughly",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 10.93,
      "end": 12.83,
      "text": "half that to build.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 12.83,
      "end": 17.39,
      "text": "So how did houses get so expensive?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 17.39,
      "end": 21.75,
      "text": "Let's use England between 1991 and 2016 as an example.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 21.75,
      "end": 26.03,
      "text": "The data is good and prices really took off.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 26.03,
      "end": 33.73,
      "text": "Maybe the demand for homes has outpaced supply.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 33.73,
      "end": 36.13,
      "text": "This is England nearly 30 years ago.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.235938,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.021255
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 36.13,
      "end": 40.37,
      "text": "There are 47 million people and 20 million homes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 40.37,
      "end": 44.81,
      "text": "Jump forward 25 years, the population has increased.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 44.81,
      "end": 48.89,
      "text": "But the supply of homes has increased even more.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 48.89,
      "end": 54.37,
      "text": "With more homes now per person, higher prices are surprising.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 54.37,
      "end": 57.73,
      "text": "Maybe how people live has pushed up the demand for homes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 57.73,
      "end": 62.81,
      "text": "If there's a trend towards living in smaller groups, there'll be a greater demand for housing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.185902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000698
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 62.81,
      "end": 67.53,
      "text": "We know that over time, people are coupling later, having smaller families, and towards",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 67.53,
      "end": 71.21,
      "text": "the end of their lives, living longer on their own.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 71.21,
      "end": 76.93,
      "text": "But even when viewed through this lens, supply and demand have remained broadly steady.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 76.93,
      "end": 82.21,
      "text": "So if there's little change here, where else might we find some answers?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 82.21,
      "end": 84.97,
      "text": "There's a load of other factors that you hear about.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 84.97,
      "end": 91.5,
      "text": "Let's check out those.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 91.5,
      "end": 94.18,
      "text": "About a million homes are empty at any one time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.168042,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002714
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 94.18,
      "end": 99.1,
      "text": "Sometimes, the reasons are understandable, like the owner has died, is moving, or the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 99.1,
      "end": 101.38,
      "text": "house is undergoing renovations.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 101.38,
      "end": 106.46,
      "text": "Occupying empty homes would help lower prices, but we're interested in why they're expensive",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 106.46,
      "end": 107.7,
      "text": "to start with.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 107.7,
      "end": 112.82,
      "text": "And as this share hasn't changed much over time, they're probably not a big reason.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 112.82,
      "end": 116.06,
      "text": "Second homes account for about 2% of the housing stock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 116.06,
      "end": 122.14,
      "text": "They're undoubtedly a factor in holiday hotspots, but probably not a big factor nationally.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148921,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.026718
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 122.14,
      "end": 126.42,
      "text": "But there's another type of additional property that has had a big impact.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 126.42,
      "end": 128.22,
      "text": "Buy to less.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 128.22,
      "end": 131.7,
      "text": "Since 1991, the number has more than doubled.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 131.7,
      "end": 138.98,
      "text": "This big increase in well-financed buyers has added a fair amount of extra demand.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 138.98,
      "end": 143.82,
      "text": "Government schemes like Help to Buy encourage developers to build and boost an individual's",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 143.82,
      "end": 144.82,
      "text": "finances.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 144.82,
      "end": 148.82,
      "text": "But, perversely, they've kept prices high overall.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.166163,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.077942
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 148.82,
      "end": 154.1,
      "text": "One free-market think tank said that the scheme was like throwing petrol onto a bonfire.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 154.1,
      "end": 157.74,
      "text": "What about building more to ease prices?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 157.74,
      "end": 163.9,
      "text": "Well, general consensus has been that we need to build around 300,000 new homes a year,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 163.9,
      "end": 167.42,
      "text": "but we've consistently not hit this target.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 167.42,
      "end": 170.62,
      "text": "So perhaps we just have to live with a messy answer then.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 170.62,
      "end": 174.38,
      "text": "Houses are expensive for a load of reasons.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 174.38,
      "end": 178.26,
      "text": "But hold on, surely one of these things must stand out?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216435,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.076782
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 178.26,
      "end": 180.94,
      "text": "Well, there is a factor we haven't talked about.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 180.94,
      "end": 185.18,
      "text": "It's a big one, and it's largely underreported.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 185.18,
      "end": 187.34,
      "text": "Let's look at another graph.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 187.34,
      "end": 195.95,
      "text": "How exciting.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 195.95,
      "end": 197.91,
      "text": "What does this show?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 197.91,
      "end": 201.07,
      "text": "Ultra-low interest rates.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 201.07,
      "end": 206.39,
      "text": "That's the Bank of England base rate, and that's an average mortgage rate.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 206.39,
      "end": 209.83,
      "text": "Those are historically low levels.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 209.83,
      "end": 212.83,
      "text": "Ultra-low interest rates mean two things.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.270312,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.015175
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 212.91,
      "end": 215.95,
      "text": "Firstly, very cheap borrowing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 215.95,
      "end": 221.15,
      "text": "10% rates versus 2% roughly doubles the size of the mortgage you'd get.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 221.15,
      "end": 225.99,
      "text": "Loaning everyone more money just gives everyone more to outbid each other.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 225.99,
      "end": 231.79,
      "text": "Secondly, falling interest rates mean safe investments, like a savings account for instance,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 231.79,
      "end": 234.59,
      "text": "make very little interest for the saver.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 234.59,
      "end": 241.03,
      "text": "This causes people to move money into things which, though a little riskier, are still earning interest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1381,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002979
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 241.03,
      "end": 244.79,
      "text": "Things like, you guessed it, property.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160689,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000855
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 244.79,
      "end": 248.51,
      "text": "This partly explains that boom in Bytele earlier.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160689,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000855
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 248.51,
      "end": 255.27,
      "text": "These two effects mean ultra-low interest rates are a much bigger factor than many realise.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160689,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000855
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 255.27,
      "end": 263.15,
      "text": "In fact, some economists, including ones at that little-known institution, the Bank of England,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160689,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000855
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 263.15,
      "end": 269.19,
      "text": "say that the decline in interest rates can account for all of the rise in house prices.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160689,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000855
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 288.68,
      "end": 292.88,
      "text": "As we saw before, not everyone is totally convinced.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.141902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 292.88,
      "end": 297.52,
      "text": "While there's more and more appreciation of the role of ultra-low interest rates,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.141902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 297.52,
      "end": 301.72,
      "text": "most still point to this bunch of other factors all playing a role,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.141902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 301.72,
      "end": 304.4,
      "text": "and it would seem the government agrees.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.141902,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000392
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 304.4,
      "end": 310.28,
      "text": "With polls now showing only 7% think it'd be good for Britain if prices keep rising,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.103308,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000842
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 310.28,
      "end": 317.24,
      "text": "in recent years, the government has introduced policies that start to address several of these factors.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.103308,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000842
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 317.24,
      "end": 323.88,
      "text": "As for interest rates, the coronavirus pandemic has brought on fears of another major economic shock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.103308,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000842
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 323.88,
      "end": 329.0,
      "text": "And lowering interest rates is a big way central banks try to get the economy moving.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.103308,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000842
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 329.0,
      "end": 332.92,
      "text": "It's why they dropped so sharply in 2008.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.103308,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000842
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 333.0,
      "end": 340.54,
      "text": "So, incredibly, they've managed to drop even further.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.234375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005207
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 340.54,
      "end": 344.1,
      "text": "What this means for house prices remains to be seen.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.234375,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005207
    }
  ],
